    3. Assign alternating colors BLUE/TEAL starting with a random choice
    4. For each rectangle, pick a width in [2, W] and a random column offset in [0, W-width]
    5. Stack rectangles top-to-bottom filling all rows
    6. Build input grid with BLACK background and place each colored rectangle
